  "summary_en": "White paper by Singapore Standards Council and ASTM International surveying global embodied AI developments and identifying five standardisation gaps: data governance, AI safety and reliability, workplace safety, interoperability/middleware, and certification. It uses Singapore as a living lab and calls for collaboration on deployment-ready test methods and internationally harmonised standards.",
