   "Identifies five standardisation gaps blocking mass-scale EAI adoption",
   "Existing standards like ISO 10218 target deterministic robots and miss learning VLA systems",
   "Calls for lifecycle governance, continuous multi-level certification and external safety monitors",
   "Recommends interoperability standards (SS 713, TR 130, Open-RMF) and procurement-ready conformance",
   "Launches collaboration via ASTM F50 committee for deployment-ready test methods"
